name: sim.getObjectUniqueIdentifier
description: 
luaSynopsis: int uniqueId=sim.getObjectUniqueIdentifier(int objectHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. objectHandle: object handle
2. uniqueIdentifier: pointer to the unique identifier
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. -1 if operation was not successful
